  "docs": {
    "description": "Multi-select box. 12 variants: checked × disabled × hover × mixed × focus. mixed renders an indeterminate dash — use it on a parent box when some, but not all, of its children are checked. Commit on click. focus combines the shared shadow/focus/default effect style with a border/feedback/focus/strong stroke, so the ring stays legible at 16px. There is no pressed state. Pair with an adjacent label — clicking the label toggles — or use Option Row, which composes this with a label and optional supporting text. For a single persistent on/off setting use Toggle.",
    "figmaIssues": []
  },
